          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Balewi, abakuru b’amazu ya ba sekuruza banditswe mu gihe ca Eliyashibu na Yoyada na Yohanani na Yaduwa; abaherezi na bo banditswe ku ngoma ya Dariyo Umuperesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.9.14+1CH.9.15+1CH.9.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 9:14-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandurutse kuri Lewi bo mu bakuru b’amazu ya ba sekuruza bari banditswe mu gitabo c’ivyo ku ngoma, kugeza igihe ca Yohanani mwene Eliyashibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:24"
          },
