            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwundi muce w’abagenda bahimbaza ugenda kubasanganira, nanje nari mbakurikiye ndi kumwe n’ikindi gice c’abantu; nuko bagenda hejuru ku ruzitiro, haruguru y’umunara w’amatanure, bashika no ku ruzitiro rw’intimba nini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze baca haruguru y’irembo ry’Abefurayimu no kw irembo rya kera, no kw irembo ryitwa iry’ Amafi, no ku munara wa Hananeli, no ku wa Hameya, bashika kw irembo ry’intama; nuko bahagarara kw irembo ry’abateramyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ iyo mice yompi y’abagenda bahimbaza ija guhagarara mu ngoro y’Imana, nanje nyene twe n’umuce w’abakuru twari kumwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bo n’abaherezi Eliyakimu na Mayaseya na Minyamini na Mikaya na Eliyowenayi na Zekariya na Hananiya bafise inzumbete; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Mayaseya na Shemaya na Eleyazari na Uzi na Yehohanani na Malakiya na Elamu na Ezeri. Maz’ abaririmvyi baririmba ijwi rirenga, Yezirahiya ni we yabarōngōra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo musi batanga ibimazi vyinshi, baranezerwa kukw Imana yar’ ibateye umunezero mwinshi; kandi n’abagore n’ abana baranezerwa, bituma umunezero ur’i Yerusalemu wumvikana kure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
