            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kur’ uyo musi batoranya abantu bo kuzezwa ivyumba vy’ ububīko vyo kubīkamw’ amashikanwa azunguzwa, n’ay’ umushuzo, n’ay’ ibigiracumi, kugira ngo bayashingure muri vyo, abe imituri y’abaherezi n’Abalewi, nk’ uko vyashinzwe mu vyagezwe, ukw imirima yo mu bisagara yangana, kukw Abayuda banezerejwe n’ukw abaherezi n’Abalewi bari kw ibango ryabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
